The taxi stops.
I say 'thank you' to the driver.
Now I am here.
This is my new street.
The street is very quiet.
There are not many people.
I look at the old houses.
They are tall and beautiful.
One house is yellow, and one house is red.
Everything is new.
It is cold here.
I have my big, red suitcase.
Where is my new home?
I am curious.
